  "incidents": [
    {
      "id": "19rfbpxckhkw",
      "name": "Elevated error rate with Android builds",
      "status": "identified",
      "created_at": "2026-04-30T11:34:31.683Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-04-30T15:32:00.114Z",
      "monitoring_at": null,
      "resolved_at": null,
      "impact": "minor",
      "shortlink": "https://stspg.io/dykldtycr0q0",
      "started_at": "2026-04-30T11:34:31.679Z",
      "page_id": "1q8r4n02vb2k",
      "incident_updates": [
        {
          "id": "6yd58h765gwc",
          "status": "identified",
          "body": "<b>What we’re doing?</b>\n\nWe have rolled out a change so that all builds have the redirection enabled by default; there is no need to add the specific steps for this, except for dependency verification (which requires a specific step version pin).\n\nWe identified upstream 401 errors and are working on a fix.\n\nWe identified a gap in the mirroring logic for Roboelectric tests, exploring our options to help mitigate the issue.\n\nWe are seeing larger latencies from Maven Central upstream, which we are investigating.\n\n<b>When will the next update be available?</b>\n\nYou can expect a status update approximately <b>1 hour</b> from now.",
          "incident_id": "19rfbpxckhkw",
          "created_at": "2026-04-30T15:32:00.111Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-04-30T15:32:00.111Z",
          "display_at": "2026-04-30T15:32:00.111Z",
          "affected_components": [
            {
              "code": "jmwzblpshvb7",
              "name": "⚙️ Builds (CI)",
              "old_status": "degraded_performance",
              "new_status": "degraded_performance"
            }
          ],
          "deliver_notifications": true,
          "custom_tweet": null,
          "tweet_id": null
        },
        {
          "id": "29dmlh8tv6xp",
          "status": "identified",
          "body": "For customers having dependency verification enabled for their Android builds, you will need to update your configuration based on our updated <b><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mrquZ-n7dNNmQo0o4ddzY73JTsY5xkYRgRKARoKNFvs/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.hldkjykpbhvu\n\">guide</a></b>.\n\nWe have identified cases where customers have cached the init scripts performing the mirror redirection. This can break the builds as the mirrors are deployed inside the datacenters, so one URL in a build won't work in another. We strongly suggest that customers to not cache anything in ~/.gradle/init.d/, and if you do, clear these contents / re-add our steps that activate the mirror.\n\n<b>When will the next update be available?</b>\n\nYou can expect a status update approximately <b>1 hour</b> from now.",
          "incident_id": "19rfbpxckhkw",
          "created_at": "2026-04-30T14:01:06.209Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-04-30T14:01:06.209Z",
          "display_at": "2026-04-30T14:01:06.209Z",
          "affected_components": [
            {
              "code": "jmwzblpshvb7",
              "name": "⚙️ Builds (CI)",
              "old_status": "degraded_performance",
              "new_status": "degraded_performance"
            }
          ],
          "deliver_notifications": true,
          "custom_tweet": null,
          "tweet_id": null
        },
        {
          "id": "7tq1hv4v6bp2",
          "status": "identified",
          "body": "<b>We are seeing some timeouts when connecting to the Maven Central proxy in one of our datacenters and are investigating. Dependency verification support is still in progress. We are exploring options to auto-enable the Gradle mirrors for our Bitrise customers.</b>\n\n<b>When will the next update be available?</b>\n\nYou can expect a status update approximately <b>1 hour</b> from now.",
          "incident_id": "19rfbpxckhkw",
          "created_at": "2026-04-30T13:04:00.874Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-04-30T13:04:00.874Z",
          "display_at": "2026-04-30T13:04:00.874Z",
          "affected_components": [
            {
              "code": "jmwzblpshvb7",
              "name": "⚙️ Builds (CI)",
              "old_status": "degraded_performance",
              "new_status": "degraded_performance"
            }
          ],
          "deliver_notifications": true,
          "custom_tweet": null,
          "tweet_id": null
        },
        {
          "id": "xxn6y9j2fbwd",
          "status": "identified",
